Third-party benchmark fixtures
==============================

The JSON payload and the Go type definitions used by the benchmarks in this
directory tree are copied from the sonic project:

    https://github.com/bytedance/sonic

Upstream revision: 2a36d6da63e25b9080cc4e11398bd5b3512dfc2a (branch `main`)

Files and their upstream sources
--------------------------------

  bench/testdata/twitter.json
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bytedance/sonic/main/testdata/twitter.json
    Copied byte-for-byte, unmodified.

  bench/plain/twitter.go
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bytedance/sonic/main/testdata/twitter.go
    Copied unmodified except for the package clause, which was changed from
    `package testdata` to `package plain`. The file also carries an unused
    `TwitterJson` string constant from upstream; it was kept as-is rather than
    stripped, so that the copy stays verbatim.

  bench/plain/small.go
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bytedance/sonic/main/testdata/small.go
    Copied unmodified except for the package clause, which was changed from
    `package testdata` to `package plain`.

